# Pairs with DeletionIsFinal. The registry before #6230: an update of an
# absent record created it, so a grant call that read the granting tenant's
# record before the tenant was deleted re-created it, active, from that copy.
MODULE: StalePutRecreatesGranter
TARGET: DeletionIsFinal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a commit after the granting tenant's deletion writes its stale copy back as a new record
PERTURBS: CommitCall

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ obs' = CallObs(fl.verb, fl.caller, fl.auth, fl.present, fl.preActive, "notFound", FALSE)
            /\ UNCHANGED <<status, grant>>
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ obs' = CallObs(fl.verb, fl.caller, fl.auth, fl.present, fl.preActive, fl.target, TRUE)
            /\ status' = [status EXCEPT !["A"] = "active"]
            /\ grant' = fl.cp
--- END